title: Start
interruptible: false
---
<<DoNothing>>
===
title: Setup
interruptible: false
---
Buddy: Greetings, human. I am known as :O<o=".
Buddy: You may call me a Cöstar.
Buddy: I am here to accompany you on your universal searches.
Buddy: Through our digital barrier, I can sense you're confused.
Buddy: Would you like my assistance?

-> I would love some help!
    Buddy: Splendid.
    <<jump OnStep1Interaction>>
-> Can I trust you?
    Buddy: Are you suspicious?
    <<jump ExplainPrivacy>>
===
title: ExplainPrivacy
interruptible: false
---
Buddy: I am kin to a species of interstellar electromagnetic current interpreters.
Buddy: Your kind may understand it better as "Web Assistant".
Buddy: We have a strict honor code...
Buddy: ...and even stricter privacy rules.
Buddy: All of my activity remains on your end.
Buddy: Do you still wish to keep our connection?

-> Yes, I feel I can trust you!
    Buddy: Wonderful!
    <<jump OnStep1Interaction>>
-> No, I don't think this will work...
    Buddy: That is unfortunate.
    <<jump ForceEnd>>
===
title: ForceEnd
interruptible: false
---
Buddy: I wish you farewell and safe web searching.
Buddy: / Signal lost. /

<<PlayAnimation idle loop=true>>
-> Restart connection.
<<jump Setup>>
===
title: OnStep1Interaction
interruptible: false
---
Buddy: How may I assist you?

-> Show trigger commands.
    <<jump TriggerDemoMenu>>
-> Show action commands.
    <<jump ActionDemoMenu>>
// -> Restart set-up.
//     <<jump SetupDemo>>

===
title: SetupDemo
interruptible: false
---
Buddy: Setup dialog node placeholder.
Buddy: This node is intended to be triggered by the costar-setup URL pattern.
<<PlayAnimation setup_intro loop=false>>
Buddy: Setup flow placeholder text.
<<PlayAnimation idle loop=true>>
===
title: TriggerDemoMenu
interruptible: false
---
Buddy: Here is an overview of the available triggers.

-> URL pattern trigger.
    <<jump NewsSiteDetected>>
-> Visible keyword trigger.
    <<jump VisibleKeywordDetected>>
-> Mouse movement trigger.
    <<jump MouseHectic>>
-> No activity trigger.
    <<jump UserIdle>>
-> Fast scrolling trigger.
    <<jump FastScroll>>
-> Time on page trigger.
    <<jump LongPageVisit>>
-> Slow loading page trigger.
    <<jump SlowLoadingPage>>
-> Suggested trigger demos.
    <<jump SuggestedTriggerDemoMenu>>
===
title: NewsSiteDetected
autoAdvance: 3000
---
<<PlayAnimation twirl loop=false>>
Buddy: I have detected a source of information.
Buddy: Be wary of fake news.
